    "blurb": "Orchestrate mortgage origination processes efficiently",
    "overview": "This blueprint demonstrates how to improve the mortgage origination process by automating validation and compliance tasks. It focuses on development skills, best practices, and architectural understanding.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Jumpstart Your Mortgage Origination Process",
    "splashDescription": "Many financial services institutions experience inefficiencies in their mortgage origination process. Organizations that want to create a program of improvement to incrementally drive efficiencies can use this blueprint as a starting point. This blueprint automates the process including mortgage application, applicant validation, property validation, approvals, and funding. The process includes capabilities for compliance with regulatory checks. This blueprint uses various components of Camunda, focusing on development skills, best practices, and architectural understanding.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/449339/overview/img3409200098776112435.png?43c72a69a001ffeb2862dd2cf279071c",
